{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：21:15 2026-10-20 HKT<br/>發佈時間：21:15 2026-10-20 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：21:15 2026-10-20 HKT</p><p>內地頂流小生井柏然今晚以全球品牌大使身份，與楊千嬅、MIRROR成員盧瀚霆（Anson Lo）、COLLAR成員邱彥筒（Marf）泰國人氣演員Mile Phakphum、陳凱琳、韓裔女星Clara等出席澳門新酒店開幕禮，吸引大批粉絲到場。當井柏然帥氣現身，在場數百名井柏然粉絲起哄高呼偶像名字，井柏然開心揮手回應粉絲支持。</p><img alt=\"井柏然為內地頂流小生。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6909b9f78a7813894f96f1300eef237e/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-20_at_19_25_04.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"井柏然開心揮手回應粉絲支持。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/98cb44a93987839c55ed7df0cb398d09/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-20_at_19_25_05.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"井柏然好親民。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/7393567b89b517922377c171fb5d31c2/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-20_at_19_25_06.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"井柏然舉手投足散發時尚魅力。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/288656beea64f9ae9f52e854f08a56f1/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-20_at_19_25_07_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"井柏然型到爆燈。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f009976a8cfe5085a7ea56d97b8de084/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-20_at_19_25_07.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"井柏然好快返入後台。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f957e79f0f348f809be510f15dbc9710/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-20_at_19_25_09_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"井柏然好有禮貌。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e14b90d8f225f9658b992c0981e34858/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-20_at_19_25_09.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"井柏然大受歡迎。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0a8a5e3e4ea1dd89131c75a86d5cbbb2/2026-10/179250146585999.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"井柏然好NICE。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e2648bd9c874a7781182d36226258c9c/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-20_at_19_25_03_1_.jpeg\"/><h2>井柏然舉手投足散發時尚魅力</h2><p>井柏然身穿西裝出現，舉手投足散發時尚魅力成為全場焦點之一，型仔到爆燈。高人氣的他大受歡迎，尖叫聲不絕耳。<br/> </p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T14:20:19.343904+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":311,"images":9,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T13:15:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T18:38:42.973220+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T14:17:47.195949+00:00","content_hash":"5c9eb92f4af9ee95e6a8fe1742a08a6ae95031dea204a75c363cbead0c66b2b7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}